    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d579">

                <pb facs="0867" n="1375" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/9–648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Jerusalem</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Macdonald</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jerusalem</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-09-06">September 6,
                        1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1256. Situation Jerusalem shown marked improvement since Thursday noon when
                    agreement reached under auspices chief UN observer here between Arab Legion,
                    Egyptian and Jewish commanders to cease all fire. Although occasional rifle fire
                    still heard, mortar and automatic fire has practically ceased. Number complaints
                    by both sides of truce violations greatly decreased.</p>
                <p>On 4th opposing forces evacuated Bed Cross zone including Government House,
                    Jewish training farm and Arab agricultural college. Demilitarized area
                    successfully established including Bed Cross zone and surrounding territory. All
                    fortifications in process removal.</p>
                <p>Sent Department as 1256, repeated Beirut as 76, Baghdad as 14, Cairo as 118,
                    Damascus as 33, Jidda and Tel Aviv by pouch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Macdonald</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
